<title>TURKEY: Turkey offers 50,000 tonnes white sugar to Iraq.</title>
<headline>Turkey offers 50,000 tonnes white sugar to Iraq.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey has offered to sell Iraq 50,000 tonnes of white sugar under the U.N. oil-for-food deal, officials said on Friday.</p>
</text>
